1
00:01:26,640 --> 00:01:27,520
Your adoptive father told you

2
00:01:27,520 --> 00:01:28,960
to get close to Yuwen Jingxuan

3
00:01:28,960 --> 00:01:30,039
and take his life.

4
00:01:31,800 --> 00:01:32,720
But look at you.

5
00:01:34,360 --> 00:01:35,820
Please calm down, Master.

6
00:01:37,720 --> 00:01:38,520
Luo Shuyan.

7
00:01:39,759 --> 00:01:40,720
Don't forget

8
00:01:41,360 --> 00:01:43,420
who bought you from the black market,

9
00:01:44,440 --> 00:01:46,900
and who gave you a status and a life of luxury.

10
00:01:48,120 --> 00:01:49,120
I know I was wrong.

11
00:01:51,200 --> 00:01:52,860
Since you know you were wrong,

12
00:01:53,200 --> 00:01:54,479
what will you do next?

13
00:01:55,759 --> 00:01:56,920
Do you understand?

14
00:01:59,160 --> 00:01:59,960
I understand.

15
00:02:12,920 --> 00:02:13,720
Come out.

16
00:02:30,600 --> 00:02:31,400
What's wrong?

17
00:02:32,200 --> 00:02:33,660
Didn't you come to kill me?

18
00:02:34,400 --> 00:02:35,280
Do it.

19
00:02:37,280 --> 00:02:40,360
Just because I look like someone you know?

20
00:02:41,520 --> 00:02:43,120
You don't just look like her.

21
00:02:43,720 --> 00:02:45,079
You are her.

22
00:02:49,440 --> 00:02:51,160
Perhaps this is what I owe you.

23
00:02:52,600 --> 00:02:54,160
You died because of me.

24
00:02:55,200 --> 00:02:57,130
So every time you come back to life,

25
00:02:58,280 --> 00:02:59,560
you want to kill me.

26
00:03:05,800 --> 00:03:06,600
Crazy.

27
00:03:07,400 --> 00:03:08,200
Yes.

28
00:03:09,640 --> 00:03:10,800
I am crazy.

29
00:03:12,600 --> 00:03:15,060
But can you really bring yourself to kill me?

30
00:03:19,920 --> 00:03:20,800
You are right.

31
00:03:21,720 --> 00:03:23,180
Although I don't know why,

32
00:03:23,920 --> 00:03:25,920
I really can't hurt you.

33
00:03:26,760 --> 00:03:29,280
But I won't stay by your side either.

34
00:03:30,800 --> 00:03:31,880
In an hour,

35
00:03:32,440 --> 00:03:34,680
your acupoints will automatically unlock.

36
00:03:34,680 --> 00:03:36,160
We will never meet again.

37
00:03:39,760 --> 00:03:41,960
I can't just let her walk away like this.

38
00:03:49,640 --> 00:03:51,170
Never see each other again?

39
00:03:51,280 --> 00:03:52,360
In your dreams.

40
00:04:05,760 --> 00:04:07,320
My sixth brother...

41
00:04:08,040 --> 00:04:11,400
What kind of spell did he cast on Tang Zhiluo

42
00:04:12,280 --> 00:04:15,640
to make her unable to kill him time and time again?

43
00:04:15,720 --> 00:04:17,180
Calm down, Your Highness.

44
00:04:18,480 --> 00:04:19,360
Fine.

45
00:04:20,680 --> 00:04:22,410
He's not afraid of death, is he?

46
00:04:22,760 --> 00:04:24,220
Then I will grant his wish.

47
00:04:24,640 --> 00:04:25,880
But Lord Shang said...

48
00:04:25,880 --> 00:04:28,040
I will explain it to my uncle.

49
00:04:30,200 --> 00:04:33,800
I never do things without a backup plan.

50
00:04:55,960 --> 00:04:57,820
According to our Rouran customs,

51
00:04:57,880 --> 00:04:59,940
wedding clothes must be sewn by hand.

52
00:05:01,280 --> 00:05:02,680
Do you not like it, Your Highness?

53
00:05:02,680 --> 00:05:03,480
Oh.

54
00:05:03,800 --> 00:05:05,880
Your craftsmanship is so good, Princess,

55
00:05:05,880 --> 00:05:07,810
that I was mesmerized for a moment.

56
00:05:09,760 --> 00:05:10,760
Try it on.

57
00:05:20,680 --> 00:05:22,210
Does it fit, Your Highness?

58
00:05:24,240 --> 00:05:26,840
It fits perfectly. Thank you, Princess Xiyao.

59
00:05:33,760 --> 00:05:35,360
You have a fine build, Your Highness.

60
00:05:35,360 --> 00:05:37,690
I still need to take in a few stitches here.

61
00:05:40,240 --> 00:05:43,240
Actually, you don't have to be so nice to me, Princess.

62
00:05:44,600 --> 00:05:45,680
We are allies,

63
00:05:45,680 --> 00:05:46,880
and husband and wife.

64
00:05:46,880 --> 00:05:48,940
It's only right that I treat you well.

65
00:06:08,040 --> 00:06:09,680
Your Highness, after returning from court,

66
00:06:09,680 --> 00:06:11,760
you spent half the day handling official documents,

67
00:06:11,760 --> 00:06:13,960
and then took me on a tour of the entire manor.

68
00:06:13,960 --> 00:06:14,960
Aren't you tired?

69
00:06:15,240 --> 00:06:17,770
If it can really help you remember something,

70
00:06:18,240 --> 00:06:19,770
I am willing to do anything.

71
00:06:21,560 --> 00:06:22,920
Your Highness, don't forget

72
00:06:22,920 --> 00:06:24,000
our agreement.

73
00:06:24,320 --> 00:06:25,080
Seven days.

74
00:06:25,080 --> 00:06:26,400
Within seven days,

75
00:06:26,920 --> 00:06:28,880
if you still can't make me remember

76
00:06:30,040 --> 00:06:31,640
the past,

77
00:06:32,240 --> 00:06:33,970
you must let me leave the manor.

78
00:06:43,320 --> 00:06:44,360
All right.

79
00:06:46,720 --> 00:06:48,120
I really can't figure out

80
00:06:48,400 --> 00:06:51,120
why Your Highness is doing these useless things.

81
00:06:51,120 --> 00:06:53,920
Is it simply out of the goodness of your heart

82
00:06:54,480 --> 00:06:57,800
to help an assassin, or...

83
00:07:34,960 --> 00:07:35,760
Jingxuan.

84
00:07:38,000 --> 00:07:39,159
All medicine has some toxicity.

85
00:07:39,159 --> 00:07:39,960
Do you have a death wish?

86
00:07:39,960 --> 00:07:41,159
Why isn't it working?

87
00:07:42,280 --> 00:07:44,280
I take my medicine on time every day.

88
00:07:44,840 --> 00:07:46,040
Why isn't it working?

89
00:07:47,920 --> 00:07:49,440
There's nothing wrong with the medicine.

90
00:07:49,440 --> 00:07:50,760
There's something wrong with the person.

91
00:07:50,760 --> 00:07:51,560
Could it be Miss Tang?

92
00:07:51,560 --> 00:07:52,360
Impossible.

93
00:07:53,080 --> 00:07:53,880
Stop talking.

94
00:07:54,760 --> 00:07:55,680
Stop talking.

95
00:07:55,840 --> 00:07:56,440
Jingxuan.

96
00:08:05,080 --> 00:08:05,880
Jingxuan.

97
00:08:18,880 --> 00:08:19,680
Zhiluo.

98
00:08:21,120 --> 00:08:21,920
Zhiluo.

99
00:08:25,440 --> 00:08:26,320
I'll go get a doctor.

100
00:08:26,320 --> 00:08:27,640
It's useless.

101
00:08:29,640 --> 00:08:33,120
I used all my strength in that palm strike just now.

102
00:08:34,760 --> 00:08:38,120
I clearly came here to kill you.

103
00:08:45,320 --> 00:08:46,840
Zhiluo, Zhiluo.
